Open the Web Interface
Go to 
https://smart-medicine-disperse-production.up.railway.app/

 — this is the web portal for your IoT medicine dispenser. 
smart-medicine-disperse-production.up.railway.app

Login / Sign Up

If you already have a user account, click on “Login”, enter your credentials, and access the system. 
smart-medicine-disperse-production.up.railway.app

If not, use “Sign Up” to register (you might need a valid student ID or other identifier, based on the system flow).

Request Medicine
Once logged in, you can request medicines via the browser interface. Your request gets sent to the backend system. 
smart-medicine-disperse-production.up.railway.app

IoT Dispenser Activation
After a valid request, the IoT dispenser (hardware) is triggered — it unlocks or dispenses the correct compartment for the requested medicine. 
smart-medicine-disperse-production.up.railway.app

Notifications & Alerts
You’ll receive real-time alerts through the dashboard, for events like:

Low stock of medicine

Expiry of medicine

Successful dispensing actions 
smart-medicine-disperse-production.up.railway.app

Transaction Logging
Every action (requests, dispensing) is logged in the system. So administrators (or you) can see a full audit trail. 
smart-medicine-disperse-production.up.railway.app

Safety & Accountability
Because the system is web-based and automated:
Unauthorized access is harder
Errors from manual dispensing are reduced

There’s better control over who is requesting what, and when
